  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Non-Explosive Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>By using electrically-lit ammo and quick-switch firing controls, (most) weapons can be (somewhat) non-lethal if used correctly.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Requires Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild to function.</strong> While connected to the weapon’s Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild and firing the weapon, the user may choose to have all ammunition expended as part of the Attack also function as Rubber Ammunition. This drains Pax’s single-shot rechargeable (1 hour) battery pack (50eb [Costly] per extra), which must be recharged or replaced before Pax can be used again. New battery packs can be loaded with an Action.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
